WEBVTT

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:11.670
Angry aunt Elroy sent Anthony to live
in the forrest mansion.

00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:21.201
However, a single carrier pigeon still
connects separated Anthony and Candy.

00:00:24.082 --> 00:00:28.942
Don't give up, Anthony!

00:00:34.277 --> 00:00:35.815
What's the matter, Kurin?

00:00:36.205 --> 00:00:36.967
Huh?

00:00:39.781 --> 00:00:42.287
A message from Anthony!

00:00:43.229 --> 00:00:44.445
Thank you!

00:00:48.422 --> 00:00:50.818
Good morning, aunt Elroy.

00:00:51.214 --> 00:00:53.079
It's grand Aunt!

00:00:53.276 --> 00:00:55.354
Y.. yes, grand Aunt.

00:00:55.942 --> 00:01:01.259
And what's the meaning of this? Yelling
from such a high place just to greet me?

00:01:01.691 --> 00:01:02.700
I'm sorry.

00:01:05.747 --> 00:01:07.142
Close the window.

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:08.790
But...

00:01:11.118 --> 00:01:12.253
Close it!

00:01:12.284 --> 00:01:16.318
A girl from the upper class doesn't
show her face on the window like that.

00:01:17.775 --> 00:01:20.256
She's taking my freedom again...

00:01:21.488 --> 00:01:23.348
Are you deaf, Candy?

00:01:24.441 --> 00:01:25.309
I understand!

00:01:28.445 --> 00:01:29.860
The pigeon...

00:01:39.055 --> 00:01:41.802
Oh no! Grand aunt is going to
discover a letter from Anthony!

00:01:43.483 --> 00:01:46.153
Do you understand?
Close the window!

00:01:47.038 --> 00:01:48.368
Somebody...!

00:01:52.553 --> 00:01:56.982
Madam, what a beautiful hat with feathers!

00:01:57.017 --> 00:01:59.011
It's a real pigeon!

00:01:59.414 --> 00:02:01.317
A real...

00:02:07.603 --> 00:02:12.418
Let's see why it stopped again...
Maybe the brakes are...

00:02:21.784 --> 00:02:24.535
Is it yours, Archie?
It seems to be carrying a note.

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:28.145
Sssshh, it's a carrier pigeon.

00:02:34.355 --> 00:02:34.991
Huh?

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:45.712
Thank you! Aunt was just about
to discover the note!

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.381
But to use a carrier pigeon...
Anthony is so considerate.

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:51.134
It was Tom's idea.

00:02:51.343 --> 00:02:53.581
Yeah, it's that cowboy, right?

00:02:54.694 --> 00:02:55.949
Hello, Candy!

00:02:57.118 --> 00:02:59.462
I've already gotten used to life in
the forrest.

00:03:00.011 --> 00:03:02.060
Tom comes to see me from time
to time.

00:03:02.778 --> 00:03:05.774
Aunt Elroy can't boss me around
anymore.

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:09.950
I have some news that's going
to startle you!

00:03:10.237 --> 00:03:13.912
I'll participate in a rodeo
at Tom's village.

00:03:14.853 --> 00:03:17.147
Anthony will be in a rodeo?

00:03:17.289 --> 00:03:20.336
What's that rodeo-thing?

00:03:20.544 --> 00:03:23.097
You only ride in cars,
so no wonder you don't know!

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:28.361
It's a competition of cowboys where they
catch cows while riding on wild horses!

00:03:29.055 --> 00:03:30.950
I wonder will Anthony be okay.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.720
He's been away for a few days,
and just look at him!

00:03:34.925 --> 00:03:38.655
We could ride wild horses too,
I'm sure.

00:03:39.603 --> 00:03:41.616
Anyway, he's not about to give up.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.960
Kurin, do you see a pigeon
waiting over there?

00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:50.008
Maybe it went back.

00:03:50.691 --> 00:03:53.406
Alright, Candy, leave this to us!

00:04:02.529 --> 00:04:03.982
What do you think, Candy?

00:04:04.182 --> 00:04:05.929
What kind of aircraft is that?

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.200
What, an aircraft?
It's a balloon.

00:04:11.503 --> 00:04:16.149
You're saying that Candy could establish
communication with Anthony using this thing?

00:04:16.531 --> 00:04:19.639
Yeah. It's much better
than a carrier pigeon.

00:04:20.223 --> 00:04:23.276
But... will it be able to
reach Anthony's place?

00:04:23.478 --> 00:04:27.838
Of course! Once you set it free, it can go
across the Pacific all the way to Japan.

00:04:28.156 --> 00:04:31.876
And, unlike a carrier pigeon, it
can carry a lot of cargo!

00:04:32.884 --> 00:04:36.657
Then, I can send him the pie
he likes so much, right?

00:04:37.267 --> 00:04:38.131
Of course!

00:04:38.985 --> 00:04:42.717
I'll tell Dorothy about this...
...and I'll send him some roses.

00:04:42.752 --> 00:04:45.019
Can it carry so much cargo, brother?

00:04:45.069 --> 00:04:47.654
Of course!
Kurin, would you like to go as well?

00:05:03.339 --> 00:05:07.406
It's OK.
Archie is keeping Aunt busy.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.276
Alright.
It's time to launch it, then.

00:05:12.074 --> 00:05:13.194
Ignition!

00:05:24.337 --> 00:05:25.883
The wind is just right!

00:05:29.258 --> 00:05:31.065
It's flying!

00:05:31.887 --> 00:05:33.169
Everything went perfectly!

00:05:34.238 --> 00:05:35.414
It's pretty!

00:05:46.931 --> 00:05:48.584
Aunt, it's your turn!

00:05:49.552 --> 00:05:52.805
Uh, Archie... did you see something
flying outside? Just now?

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:55.826
-That's...
-Nothing to worry about!

00:05:56.039 --> 00:05:57.905
Now, it's your turn, Aunt!

00:06:04.396 --> 00:06:06.014
Its course it just as expected.

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:10.223
It will really reach Anthony's place, right?

00:06:10.652 --> 00:06:13.133
It can go much further than a pigeon.

00:06:14.197 --> 00:06:16.997
Huh? Mr. Stear and miss Candy!

00:06:18.818 --> 00:06:21.734
What are you doing out here?

00:06:22.461 --> 00:06:24.228
Uh... we're looking at the stars.

00:06:25.016 --> 00:06:26.708
Stars?

00:06:27.569 --> 00:06:29.307
Uh... it was over there!

00:06:29.342 --> 00:06:30.541
Yeah, look this way!

00:06:30.606 --> 00:06:31.561
Huh?

00:06:55.444 --> 00:06:56.684
Brother!

00:06:58.469 --> 00:07:00.109
Brother, it's an emergency!

00:07:01.109 --> 00:07:04.212
What, did you get any new ideas?

00:07:04.686 --> 00:07:05.832
Out there...!

00:07:11.231 --> 00:07:12.635
What's that thing?

00:07:12.836 --> 00:07:14.092
I have a bad feeling...

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.306
It's coming this way!

00:07:24.507 --> 00:07:25.551
Mother!

00:07:28.732 --> 00:07:30.034
Mother!

00:07:35.294 --> 00:07:42.286
I didn't think you would miss Anthony to
the point when you'd use something like this.

00:07:43.336 --> 00:07:47.727
Your thing there went off the mark since
it was dark. It just didn't work, Candy.

00:07:49.412 --> 00:07:51.944
Are you sure you set it in
the right direction, brother?

00:07:52.341 --> 00:07:53.955
Uh... it's strange...

00:07:55.528 --> 00:07:57.986
Candy wrote this letter, right?

00:07:59.457 --> 00:08:00.078
Yes.

00:08:02.929 --> 00:08:06.291
Aunt, it would be better if
you used your glasses.

00:08:06.344 --> 00:08:07.710
I know.

00:08:10.007 --> 00:08:11.133
Rodeo?!

00:08:11.296 --> 00:08:14.813
Are you saying that Anthony
is going on that dangerous rodeo?!

00:08:15.872 --> 00:08:16.686
Yes.

00:08:17.929 --> 00:08:23.663
I won't let him! A pride of the Adley
family can't be seen as a cowboy!

00:08:24.029 --> 00:08:28.157
What would we do if something
was to happen to Anthony?

00:08:28.371 --> 00:08:31.798
I'm sure that it was Candy
who put that idea in his head.

00:08:32.396 --> 00:08:33.381
That's not true!

00:08:34.627 --> 00:08:38.136
Yes, entering a rodeo was Anthony's own idea!

00:08:38.171 --> 00:08:43.228
There is no way that this gentle Anthony
would have entered a violent rodeo competition.

00:08:43.633 --> 00:08:44.922
Right, aunt?

00:08:44.957 --> 00:08:47.560
No, this has nothing to do with Candy!

00:08:48.239 --> 00:08:51.897
Anyway, I'll have to make Anthony quit
from the rodeo.

00:08:51.932 --> 00:08:58.243
Aunt, I'll go to the forrest mansion.
I'm sure that Anthony will...

00:08:58.633 --> 00:09:00.279
Uh, I'm not really sure...

00:09:01.525 --> 00:09:02.612
What do you mean?

00:09:02.766 --> 00:09:04.208
Be quiet.

00:09:08.056 --> 00:09:08.957
Candy!

00:09:09.581 --> 00:09:10.667
Yes!

00:09:12.241 --> 00:09:14.805
Immediately go to the forrest mansion.
You understand?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.074
Aunt!

00:09:16.489 --> 00:09:19.454
Talking Anthony out of this is Candy's duty.

00:09:20.872 --> 00:09:21.785
Mine...?

00:09:22.585 --> 00:09:26.469
Yeah, if it's you, Anthony might
listen to your words.

00:09:26.504 --> 00:09:28.565
Are you saying that he wouldn't
have listened to me?

00:09:29.741 --> 00:09:31.183
Do you understand, Candy?

00:09:32.719 --> 00:09:34.269
Uh...

00:09:35.331 --> 00:09:39.749
If Anthony enters the rodeo
and something happens to him,

00:09:39.784 --> 00:09:41.609
...I will hold you responsible, Candy.

00:09:41.819 --> 00:09:42.454
Yes.

00:09:56.882 --> 00:09:58.958
Keep it like that!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.136
Get down, Anthony!

00:10:13.449 --> 00:10:17.218
Real horses are much wilder than this one!

00:10:17.411 --> 00:10:19.004
Alright, let's try again!

00:10:22.446 --> 00:10:23.878
I think somebody is coming.

00:10:32.416 --> 00:10:34.788
It's Candy!
Candy is coming this way!

00:10:35.888 --> 00:10:37.299
Huh, Candy?

00:10:39.101 --> 00:10:41.896
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is an engrish version. If you want english,
then... uh, okay, you don't get an english version.

00:10:51.708 --> 00:10:52.474
Candy!

00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:55.891
Anthony!

00:10:57.032 --> 00:10:59.109
Hello, Candy.
It's been a while.

00:10:59.547 --> 00:11:00.925
How are you?

00:11:01.874 --> 00:11:03.858
This greeting it not like you, Candy!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:08.678
You're looking much tougher from the
time we last saw each other.

00:11:10.565 --> 00:11:13.689
And you've become more like a lady!

00:11:14.301 --> 00:11:14.945
Oh!

00:11:22.111 --> 00:11:24.561
What? To give up the rodeo?

00:11:24.562 --> 00:11:26.199
Isn't it dangerous?

00:11:26.828 --> 00:11:29.899
Of course it is. Much more dangerous
than growing roses, right?

00:11:31.318 --> 00:11:33.651
Aunt Elroy is very determined
about this!

00:11:33.969 --> 00:11:36.985
Of couse, it was aunt
who sent you here!

00:11:37.366 --> 00:11:38.575
Yeah... uh...

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.769
And now you are going to
tell me to quit?

00:11:41.965 --> 00:11:48.096
That's right... but when I saw you
up there, it didn't seem that dangerous...

00:11:48.329 --> 00:11:53.271
Candy, one can get hurt even
while taking care of the roses!

00:11:53.436 --> 00:11:54.505
That's right!

00:11:55.718 --> 00:12:01.633
Candy, as you know, as a member of
the Adley family,

00:12:01.668 --> 00:12:05.857
...wealthy life and high social status
were guaranteed for me.

00:12:05.919 --> 00:12:08.061
To be rich all your life, right?

00:12:08.495 --> 00:12:12.722
But lately, such a lifestyle
has become a huge burden for me.

00:12:13.167 --> 00:12:16.612
I want to work and shed sweat, just like Tom.

00:12:18.278 --> 00:12:20.719
Anthony, I understand your feelings.

00:12:20.796 --> 00:12:23.976
Then, do you agree with me
going on a rodeo?

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.483
Yes, of course!

00:12:26.518 --> 00:12:29.968
But Candy, won't you get in
trouble if he enters the rodeo?

00:12:30.607 --> 00:12:33.573
Yes, there is still aunt to worry about.

00:12:33.769 --> 00:12:35.266
I just got a good idea!

00:12:36.573 --> 00:12:38.451
Candy, enter the rodeo as well!

00:12:39.239 --> 00:12:41.364
You want me to ride wild horses?

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:44.566
There is also a lasso-throwing
competition at a rodeo!

00:12:45.383 --> 00:12:47.131
I'm pretty good at that!

00:12:47.132 --> 00:12:50.872
That's right! I'll get Stear
and Archie to participate as well!

00:12:51.679 --> 00:12:52.864
Good idea!

00:12:53.592 --> 00:12:57.922
If all of us enter the competition, maybe
aunt Elroy won't be able to refuse then!

00:12:57.957 --> 00:13:02.081
If we all stick together,
we could oppose aunt!

00:13:02.658 --> 00:13:03.811
Alright!

00:13:06.287 --> 00:13:08.404
What?
We too?

00:13:08.751 --> 00:13:09.645
Yeah!

00:13:10.568 --> 00:13:14.960
We can't do that! None of us
can ride horses or throw a lasso.

00:13:15.221 --> 00:13:17.208
We'll make fool out of ourselves...

00:13:18.043 --> 00:13:20.128
Even little kids are going
to participate!

00:13:20.243 --> 00:13:21.813
But I don't think I can do that...

00:13:22.795 --> 00:13:27.207
Don't worry! I know of a perfect
kind of competition for you!

00:13:28.395 --> 00:13:29.607
What kind of competition?

00:13:30.287 --> 00:13:32.381
A cow-milking competition!

00:13:38.482 --> 00:13:39.789
Milking...?

00:13:40.421 --> 00:13:46.877
I wanted Anthony to quit, and now
even the rest of you plan on entering?

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.340
Yes, aunt.

00:13:50.201 --> 00:13:51.934
It's grand aunt!

00:13:54.858 --> 00:13:57.674
Uh, we are going to compete in
cow-milking, which is safe.

00:13:58.106 --> 00:14:02.240
Stear, are you saying that an Adley should
try to milk a cow in front of other people?

00:14:02.641 --> 00:14:05.210
Aunt, please come and watch us!

00:14:05.334 --> 00:14:07.571
It's an incredibly fun festival!

00:14:08.211 --> 00:14:11.701
Get out! I don't want to speak to you!

00:14:26.561 --> 00:14:29.743
Want to try it out after Dorothy?

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.355
Okay.

00:14:37.606 --> 00:14:40.631
It's embarassing... touching someone's breasts...

00:14:41.607 --> 00:14:44.206
Just think that it's a car's engine!

00:14:44.803 --> 00:14:45.811
Engine?

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:48.555
Anthony!

00:14:54.035 --> 00:14:55.055
Anthony!

00:14:58.621 --> 00:14:59.817
What's the matter, Anthony?

00:15:01.714 --> 00:15:03.755
We can't go to the rodeo.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.751
What happened?

00:15:06.392 --> 00:15:10.600
It's not just me... none of
us can go to the rodeo.

00:15:11.801 --> 00:15:14.373
What do you mean, Anthony?

00:15:14.588 --> 00:15:19.945
Aunt Elroy paid a visit to the rodeo managers,
and arranged so that we wouldn't be accepted.

00:15:22.023 --> 00:15:23.924
Such a thing...

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:29.737
She said that we wouldn't be allowed to do
such things, as long as we're living here!

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.916
In that case, I will leave this house!

00:15:36.452 --> 00:15:38.240
Hey... calm down, Anthony!

00:15:38.479 --> 00:15:41.686
I'm Anthony Brown!
I'm not aunt's puppet!

00:15:41.986 --> 00:15:43.685
Wait, Anthony!

00:15:48.471 --> 00:15:51.439
Aunt Elroy doesn't want us
to enter the rodeo

00:15:51.474 --> 00:15:53.656
...for the sake of the
Adley family reputation!

00:15:53.691 --> 00:15:58.961
That's right. Proud and respectable Adleys wouldn't
take part in uncivilized things like rodeos.

00:16:00.602 --> 00:16:01.854
It's okay!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.781
I have a good idea.

00:16:10.681 --> 00:16:13.110
Finally, a rodeo!

00:16:15.172 --> 00:16:19.427
Hey, Adley!
You cowards!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.297
Cowards!

00:16:22.055 --> 00:16:23.541
Stop the carriage!

00:16:27.671 --> 00:16:29.021
Thank you!

00:16:32.157 --> 00:16:33.766
Adley granny!

00:16:33.986 --> 00:16:36.222
Granny...?
What are you saying!

00:16:36.541 --> 00:16:39.111
Is that coward Anthony okay?

00:16:39.624 --> 00:16:43.118
Who are you to call Anthony a coward?

00:16:43.333 --> 00:16:49.456
It's not only Anthony. The whole town
knows that every single Adley is a coward.

00:16:49.653 --> 00:16:50.957
That's enough!

00:16:50.992 --> 00:16:54.170
I won't let you insult
the Adley family any more!

00:16:54.363 --> 00:16:56.540
But they suddenly chickened out
from the rodeo...

00:16:56.541 --> 00:16:58.485
You know, maybe they were
ashamed to admit this,

00:16:58.486 --> 00:17:01.998
...but wasn't it because you granny forbade
them from taking part in the rodeo?

00:17:02.156 --> 00:17:04.761
Who told you that?!

00:17:05.025 --> 00:17:09.300
Everybody in the town knows that.
That all Adleys are big cowards.

00:17:09.335 --> 00:17:10.746
Let's go!

00:17:20.711 --> 00:17:26.869
I heard it in the marketplace...
People there are spreading the rumours around...

00:17:27.293 --> 00:17:28.617
I can't believe this.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.687
Call the children.

00:17:31.249 --> 00:17:32.765
As you wish.

00:17:40.555 --> 00:17:43.934
I will allow you to enter the rodeo.

00:17:47.959 --> 00:17:51.908
Aunt Elroy, but what about the
Adley family reputation...

00:17:52.476 --> 00:17:55.814
Our reputation is exactly the reason why
I'm allowing you to take part in the rodeo.

00:17:55.816 --> 00:17:57.250
In return, I expect you to win!

00:18:00.011 --> 00:18:01.817
Aunt, banzai!

00:18:04.373 --> 00:18:06.236
Uh, I mean... grand aunt.

00:18:17.809 --> 00:18:20.683
Anthony, let's cheer each other on.

00:18:20.684 --> 00:18:21.360
Yeah.

00:18:21.546 --> 00:18:27.736
Thanks to you, we won the fight against aunt Elroy.
And now, I'm going to win against wild horses!

00:18:59.085 --> 00:19:00.734
Hey, it's Tom's turn!

00:19:04.304 --> 00:19:08.031
Tom, if you don't win,
you won't get anything for dinner!

00:19:08.066 --> 00:19:11.715
Don't worry, dad!
Leave it to me!

00:19:12.904 --> 00:19:14.178
Okay, don't give up!

00:19:18.001 --> 00:19:19.857
Tom, hang in there!

00:19:40.305 --> 00:19:43.055
Twenty seconds exactly!
That's great, Tom!

00:19:45.827 --> 00:19:48.609
He did it!
It's Anthony's turn now!

00:19:51.439 --> 00:19:52.155
Go!

00:19:56.305 --> 00:19:58.046
Go, Anthony!

00:20:01.472 --> 00:20:02.958
Master Anthony!

00:20:04.801 --> 00:20:07.581
Hey, Candy, when is he going to fall?

00:20:07.994 --> 00:20:08.986
Anthony...

00:20:09.038 --> 00:20:10.719
He can't hear you!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.928
He has the best time!

00:20:24.708 --> 00:20:26.501
Anthony!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.904
Aunt Elroy...?

00:20:40.949 --> 00:20:43.511
38 seconds!
By far, the best time!

00:20:48.607 --> 00:20:50.213
You did it, brother!

00:20:50.774 --> 00:20:53.895
-Congratulations, Anthony!
-Congratulations!

00:21:07.108 --> 00:21:09.078
Anthony won.

00:21:09.642 --> 00:21:12.976
Against grand aunt Elroy,
and in the rodeo as well.

00:21:14.733 --> 00:21:16.290
Congratulations, Anthony.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:20.338
To be continued.
